This Academic and/or non-profit Internal Research End User Agreement (the “Agreement”), sets forth the terms of use governing your (the “End User”) use of the Software. The Software is being released on GitHub for free by DFCI to the End User solely for academic and/or non-profit internal research purposes (the “Purpose”).

